{"unit_id":"In-clude__dsh-approval-reminder#card-zh","repo":"In-clude/dsh-approval-reminder","commit":"d6fce2e9cda145b6df15889a91165f2645ecd025","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-reminder 是面向 DSH Web 的浏览器通知插件：在会话等待审批或用户选择、以及任务运行结束时提醒你。它通过读取客户端会话状态，在页面失焦或切到后台时发送对应会话的桌面通知，并提供通知设置页。主要功能包括审批提醒、提问与计划审阅提醒、任务完成提醒、通知权限测试和可选提示音；点击通知可返回对应会话。适合使用 DSH Web、需要离开页面处理其他工作的用户；需在浏览器中授权桌面通知。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:403-465","client.js:635-718","client.js:894-905"]}
{"unit_id":"In-clude__dsh-approval-reminder#card-en","repo":"In-clude/dsh-approval-reminder","commit":"d6fce2e9cda145b6df15889a91165f2645ecd025","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-approval-reminder sends DSH Web desktop alerts when a session awaits approval or a choice, or when a task finishes. It reads session status in the background. Settings control alerts and an optional chime. Clicking returns to the session; browser notification permission is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:403-465","client.js:635-718","client.js:894-905"]}
