{"unit_id":"In-clude__dsh-approval-reminder#feature-1","repo":"In-clude/dsh-approval-reminder","commit":"d6fce2e9cda145b6df15889a91165f2645ecd025","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-reminder 的功能「审批等待提醒」：审批等待提醒：会话出现待审批交互且页面不在前台时，发出带请求原因和会话名的桌面通知；点击可回到该会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:403-465","client.js:635-667"]}
