{"unit_id":"In-clude__dsh-approval-reminder#caveat-1","repo":"In-clude/dsh-approval-reminder","commit":"d6fce2e9cda145b6df15889a91165f2645ecd025","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-approval-reminder 只在 DSH Web 页面保持打开时读取会话状态；关闭页面后不会继续送达提醒。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:917-918","README.md:84-89"]}
